        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mark \"Chopper\" Read; Hyjak N Torcha; Justice; Lazy Grey; Lotek; Matty B; Necro; Phrase\n- Products: Interview with a Madman\n- Companies: Rott'n Records\n- Topics: hip hop music; organised crime; jail time; ear mutilation; crime novels; children's books\n\nFacts:\n- Mark \"Chopper\" Read wrote a series of semi-autobiographical fictional crime novels and children's books.\n- On March 13, 2006, Rott'n Records released Interview with a Madman, a hip hop album by Australian criminal Mark \"Chopper\" Read.\n- Interview with a Madman features gritty tales of organised crime, jail time, and ear mutilation.\n- Mark \"Chopper\" Read was supported on Interview with a Madman by beats and guest appearances from Hyjak N Torcha, Justice, Lazy Grey, Lotek, Matty B, Necro, Phrase, and various other hip hop artists.",
